<title>USA: InfoNow cancels private placement.</title>
<headline>InfoNow cancels private placement.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>InfoNow Corp said Monday it has canceled its proposed private placement announced on May 6, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The current market did not support the target price level for this offering,&quot; InfoNow chief executive officer Michael Johnson said in a press release. &quot;We therefore felt it was in the best interest of the Company not to proceed.&quot;</p>
</text>
